OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 DEC
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GSir Willard White is live in
OL,6,     Gstudio to perform live with
OL,7,     Gpianist Eugene Asti. Katie Derham
OL,8,     Galso introduces live music from
OL,9,     GBaroque music group Lowe Ensemble.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GHalf an hour of classical music,
OL,12,     Gincluding some festive favourites
OL,13,     Gby Rutter, Britten and Lauridsen.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GKazuki Yamada conducts the City
OL,16,     Gof Birmingham Symphony Orchestra
OL,17,     Gin an all-Strauss programme,
OL,18,     Gincluding Also Sprach
OL,19,     GZarathustra, a piece with one of
OL,20,     Gmusic's most iconic openings.
