OL,10,     Gsound.
OL,11,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,12,     GRachel Podger plays violin
OL,13,     Gsonatas by Biber and Froberger
OL,14,     Gwith lutenist Elizabeth Kenny and
OL,15,     GMarcin Swiatkiewicz at the
OL,16,     Gharpsichord. Penny Gore presents.
